WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:06.829
Three hundred and fifty-nine thousand registered lobbying communications recorded in the Office of the Commissioner of Lobbying registry.

00:00:06.829 --> 00:00:10.022
The health sector shows the highest lobbying concentration.

00:00:10.022 --> 00:00:15.625
Procurement sector lobbying correlates directly with MAID cost savings and healthcare outsourcing contracts.

00:00:15.625 --> 00:00:20.409
Finance sector lobbyists maintain direct access to the Prime Minister and the PMO.

00:00:20.409 --> 00:00:26.090
The NorthRiver lobbying firm directed communications to Mark Carney before and during his ascent to the PMO.

00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:32.374
One hundred and three entities now fall under Carney's mandatory recusal requirement due to conflicts of interest.

00:00:32.374 --> 00:00:37.170
Policy outcomes have been tracked against lobbying investment patterns across the database.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:42.011
The correlation between lobbying expenditure and policy direction is not theoretical.

00:00:42.011 --> 00:00:44.977
It is documented, registered, and public.
